# (the binary modulo of the library plover_compositions, which problems
# spell the same), and the prelude's fixpoint, Turing's combinator with no
# marker, which hindley_milner_unions types only under the marker $generic
# (native_types' fixpoint). A `$name`-tagged library name is typed by a scheme
# only, never by its body (unions_occurrence_candidate), so a program over
# binary naturals or over the prelude's fixpoint keeps its types symbolic
# without these. Enabled in the type-check round beside binary_wren_shapes,
# whose candidacy of the binary naturals' structure the binary schemes rely
# on: the recursive type of three alternatives written out in each binary
# scheme below.
#
